# Wave W17-AC (Route 227): stark sand — the ash road’s pale sand, design-authorised: a pale ash-grey sand running Palmside’s gate to the mountain’s door, grey fall settled into its tread the whole way (design: the Stark road — ash on the wind, and the door at the end of it). Split from Route 225’s worn zone sand by temperature entire (ash-grey cool vs kiln warm) and from Route 226’s cliff sand by burden: this sand carries ash, that one carries spray.
